Z||000008||MinnGreenGT||12-19-2001||03:23 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AusFiero:<BR><B> Hehehe Minn. How to give a present without spending. You cheapskate you   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> J/K<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Whatever works!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> And yup, I've had to shop on a budget many times... and worked for every one of them (hmmm... maybe shouldn't let stuff like that out  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)<P>In light of other's suggestions, why not combine them? A stuffed animal, with a rose (fire & ice is good), and the coupons! Not too expensive... and sweet in every aspect.||||reg||1
