Z||000018||JSocha||12-20-2001||12:49 AM||||Tigger, just head down to your local florist.  They may have to order it, but typically, most larger florists carry them.  Relatively inexpensive $3-$10 for a single rose and just about every women I know loves them compared to other roses.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>And if you want to know the meaning of each rose, go to <A HREF="http://www.roses.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.roses.com</A>  and click on "Meanings".  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_brow.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> BTW, how do you know she has the entire Bath and Body Works store in her bathroom?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> hehehe||||reg||7
Z||000019||fierospeeder||12-20-2001||12:51 AM||||buy her a fiero, if she doesn't like it then you can play with it.<P><BR>buy her lotion, women love lotion, and women love it when you rub lotion all over them.  Then when you get done, they say thank you, and tell you to go home.||||reg||1
