Z||000023||TTiger||12-20-2001||02:11 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Ken Wittlief:<BR><B>make sure you read the 101 wurstest gift thread - dont buy anything listed there.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I already looked into that thread.  LOL, but not much help.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Ken Wittlief:<BR><B><BR> women really do want to think they you are obsessed with them - so even though you have only known her for 4 weeks, she expects you should know her favorite color by now, what music shes likes, her pastimes and interest - thats what I meant about being tested -</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE> <P>Isn't that the truth.  That is exactly how she is thinking right now.  Sucks, too.  I've known her for a year and a half now, but I have always had a girlfriend during that time!!  Now she "comes along" and thinks I know everything about her.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Ken Wittlief:<BR><B><BR>if you are spending time with her cause you are only interested in 'one thing' then on christmas day you are a dead man!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> It's not even about that!!  I have finally found someone that I can have fun spending time with.  That's all I wanted. I don't think I have much to worry about on Christmas day for that reason.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierobaby:<BR><B>well last place I saw one of those pie pets wasat a local nursery (where you buy plants) you could give them a shot or they might know where you can get one I would laugh really hard if someone go me one of them!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>DAMMIT!!!! That would have been a perfect gift for her too.  I don't think the nurseries around here will have anything like that  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  I'll check, though.<P>Sounds like you have the same sense of humor as the girl I'm seeing.<P>Tony<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttigersig_17.gif"> <P>||||reg||14
Z||000024||TTiger||12-24-2001||05:06 PM||||Thanks for the ideas everyone!!  I finally made up my mind yesterday (when I started my Christmas shopping  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> )<P>I used Jaygee79's idea of the teddy bear holding the rose (couldn't find the fire and ice rose  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> )  I also used the Bath and Body Works idea from annieL and got her sweet pea scented lotion.  She also requested me to find her a perfume that I liked best... and I will not go into the detail in that conversation    <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/smokin.gif"> <P>Too bad I couldn't find the cow poop pet thing.  She would have liked that.<P>Thanks all.<BR>Tony<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttigersig_19.gif"> <BR>||||reg||14
